  "rationale": "Block configSecret:credentialAccess and ssoLogin:authenticate. Blocking configSecret stops dbLogin, which cuts off jumpHost and therefore vaultRead. With configSecret, ssoLogin and dbLogin all blocked, monitoringHost becomes unreachable. That removes codeRepo and also dbReplica, since both localAdmin and serviceAccount require monitoringHost. Blocking ssoLogin also stops secretsManager, which removes shareMount. All four parents of crownData are then unreachable. No single block suffices, because monitoringHost has separate routes and jumpHost/vaultRead does not depend on it."
